		<chapter num="2">
			<begin-paragraph/>
			<v n="1">
				This is 
				<crossref let="b" cid="c150021.1"/>
				 a list of the Jewish exiles from the province who returned from captivity after King Nebuchadnezzar had taken them away to Babylon. They went back to Jerusalem and to their own towns in Judah.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002002"/>
			<v n="2">
