				<crossref let="c" cid="c150022.1"/>
				 were Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Reelaiah, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum, and Baanah.This is the number of the men of the people of Israel:
			</v>
